Section 2 of the paper defines RWB-Dominating Set and proves polynomial
kernelization on K_{i,j}-free graphs.  This module inverse-generates a native
RWB graph given exactly by false-twin bundles.  Its compatibility bundles form
a cycle of permutations of a finite projective line.  The planted choices are
sampled first; projective transformations and then the graph are built around
